<h1>CacheView refusal validation</h1>

<p>This static SSR sample isolates each .NET 11 <code>CacheView</code> refusal or conditional behavior on its own route.</p>

<table class="table">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Component</th>
            <th>Intentional refusal</th>
            <th>Resolved behavior</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td><code>AuthorizeView</code></td>
            <td><a href="/authorize/refusal">No user vary-by</a></td>
            <td><a href="/authorize/fixed">Vary by user</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><code>QuickGrid</code></td>
            <td><a href="/quickgrid/refusal">No query vary-by</a></td>
            <td><a href="/quickgrid/fixed?sort=name&amp;direction=ascending&amp;page=1">Vary by query</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><code>UserBadge</code></td>
            <td><a href="/user-badge/refusal">No vary-by</a> / <a href="/user-badge/refusal-varied">With vary-by</a></td>
            <td><a href="/user-badge/fixed">Outside the boundary</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td><code>PricePanel</code></td>
            <td><a href="/price/live">Live rerender without cookie vary-by</a></td>
            <td><a href="/price/cached">Cache reuse with cookie vary-by</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Nested <code>CacheView</code></td>
            <td><a href="/nested/refusal">Nested boundary</a></td>
            <td>Move the inner boundary outside the outer boundary.</td>
